WEBVTT

1
00:51:53.546 --> 00:51:54.546
Hallelujah!

2
00:52:06.546 --> 00:52:08.546
Is everyone happy in this room?

3
00:52:10.546 --> 00:52:11.546
No one?

4
00:52:14.546 --> 00:52:15.546
Hallelujah!

5
00:52:16.546 --> 00:52:19.546
The holiday season is coming to an end.

6
00:52:20.546 --> 00:52:22.546
The teenagers...

7
00:52:23.546 --> 00:52:25.546
The Dutch teenagers are, in my opinion, already...

8
00:52:25.546 --> 00:52:27.546
And children are, in my opinion, already back to school, right?

9
00:52:27.546 --> 00:52:30.546
Give a wave if you are already going to school.

10
00:52:30.546 --> 00:52:32.546
Tomorrow is that.

11
00:52:32.546 --> 00:52:34.546
And all the parents say...

12
00:52:39.546 --> 00:52:40.546
Classic, huh?

13
00:52:40.546 --> 00:52:41.546
Delightful.

14
00:52:43.546 --> 00:52:48.546
The Belgian children and teenagers can still enjoy a week or two of vacation.

15
00:52:48.546 --> 00:52:50.546
So pray for those parents as well.

16
00:52:50.546 --> 00:52:52.546
In Jesus' name.

17
00:52:52.546 --> 00:52:55.546
Are there still people going on vacation in the coming time?

18
00:52:56.546 --> 00:52:57.546
Wow, so many still?

19
00:52:57.546 --> 00:52:58.546
So late?

20
00:52:59.546 --> 00:53:00.546
Wow, that is amazing.

21
00:53:00.546 --> 00:53:02.546
So enjoying, late summer.

22
00:53:03.546 --> 00:53:05.546
Delightful, delightful. Hallelujah.

23
00:53:06.546 --> 00:53:07.546
Praise God.

24
00:53:08.546 --> 00:53:09.546
Praise God.

25
00:53:09.546 --> 00:53:11.546
We really had such a nice week.

26
00:53:12.546 --> 00:53:15.546
Everyone who was there...

27
00:53:15.546 --> 00:53:19.546
Last week I can hear an amen from you how nice it was.

28
00:53:19.546 --> 00:53:21.546
It was really nice, wasn't it?

29
00:53:21.546 --> 00:53:23.546
And the week flew by.

30
00:53:23.546 --> 00:53:25.546
It went by so fast.

31
00:53:25.546 --> 00:53:27.546
The children's camp was amazing.

32
00:53:27.546 --> 00:53:30.546
As I heard from my own children and from the leaders.

33
00:53:31.546 --> 00:53:33.546
The youth camp was amazing.

34
00:53:33.546 --> 00:53:34.546
And...

35
00:53:34.546 --> 00:53:38.546
We will pray shortly at the end of the sermon.

36
00:53:38.546 --> 00:53:39.546
We will pray there...

37
00:53:39.546 --> 00:53:44.546
That what God has sown in the hearts of the children and teenagers...

38
00:53:44.546 --> 00:53:47.546
That this seed may not be stolen by Satan.

39
00:53:47.546 --> 00:53:48.546
Is that a good idea?

40
00:53:48.546 --> 00:53:52.546
Then at the end of this service we will collectively pray as a church.

41
00:53:52.546 --> 00:53:55.546
For you see, the Bible also speaks that Jesus...

42
00:53:55.546 --> 00:53:57.546
Listen, then I may say...

43
00:53:57.546 --> 00:53:59.546
The after-preacher is.

44
00:53:59.546 --> 00:54:00.546
That means...

45
00:54:00.546 --> 00:54:03.546
When children and teenagers return home from a wonderful camp...

46
00:54:03.546 --> 00:54:06.546
They do not just go back without Jesus.

47
00:54:06.546 --> 00:54:10.546
Jesus is not bound to a building...

48
00:54:10.546 --> 00:54:12.546
Or to a tent at camp.

49
00:54:12.546 --> 00:54:14.546
That He is only there.

50
00:54:14.546 --> 00:54:16.546
He is the living God.

51
00:54:16.546 --> 00:54:20.546
And He goes with you wherever you are.

52
00:54:20.546 --> 00:54:24.546
And some teenagers go home to a very nice home situation.

53
00:54:24.546 --> 00:54:27.546
Some teenagers or children go home...

54
00:54:27.546 --> 00:54:29.546
Where there is no nice home situation.

55
00:54:29.546 --> 00:54:32.546
Some teenagers or children go home...

56
00:54:32.546 --> 00:54:34.546
That they feel okay about themselves.

57
00:54:34.546 --> 00:54:38.546
Some children and teenagers are going through stormy times in their lives.

58
00:54:38.546 --> 00:54:40.546
Full of fear and stress.

59
00:54:40.546 --> 00:54:42.546
And you know, when they come to such a camp...

60
00:54:42.546 --> 00:54:47.546
They come into an oasis of freedom and love and embrace.

61
00:54:47.546 --> 00:54:52.546
And the Word of God is spoken over them in the name of Jesus.

62
00:54:52.546 --> 00:54:55.546
But Jesus will then go home with them.

63
00:54:55.546 --> 00:54:57.546
To be the after-preacher.

64
00:54:57.546 --> 00:55:00.546
To say in whatever situation they go to.

65
00:55:00.546 --> 00:55:03.546
That He says, hey, but I am with you.

66
00:55:03.546 --> 00:55:04.546
I am with you.

67
00:55:04.546 --> 00:55:07.546
So that they will never let go of the seed again.

68
00:55:07.546 --> 00:55:09.546
Do we all find that worth an amen?

69
00:55:09.546 --> 00:55:10.546
Good.

70
00:55:10.546 --> 00:55:13.546
Hey, we have a video, so if the lights could be dimmed a bit please.

71
00:55:13.546 --> 00:55:17.546
We have a video from the youth camp.

72
00:55:17.546 --> 00:55:21.546
And it would be nice if you would like to watch that.

73
